RadioTower_Interior2_Text_Youngster::
	.string "You can watch the RADIO-VISIO\n"
	.string "anywhere. Tune in!$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_Jigglypuff::
	.string "JYGGLYPUFF: Jiggly...$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_Policeman::
	.string "Sorry. Authorized personnel only\n"
	.string "beyond this point.\p"
	.string "It wasn’t that way before.\p"
	.string "There’s something wrong with the\n"
	.string "DIRECTOR...$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_Woman2_1::
	.string "Lullabies on the radio may make\n"
	.string "POKéMON sleep.$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_Woman2_2::
	.string "Why would they want to take over\n"
	.string "the RADIO TOWER?$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_TeamRocketGrunt23Intro::
	.string "We’re TEAM ROCKET, the exploiters of\n"
	.string "POKéMON!\p"
	.string "We love being evil!\n"
	.string "Scared?$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_TeamRocketGrunt23Defeat::
	.string "You think you’re a hero?$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_TeamRocketGrunt23::
	.string "We’re not always evil. We just do\n"
	.string "whatever we like.$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_TeamRocketGrunt35Intro::
	.string "Hahaha!\p"
	.string "How boring.\n"
	.string "It was far too easy to take over\l"
	.string "this place!\p"
	.string "Come on, keep me amused!$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_TeamRocketGrunt35Defeat::
	.string "Wh-who are you?$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_TeamRocketGrunt35::
	.string "You beat me, and I won’t forget it!$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_TeamRocketGrunt33Intro::
	.string "Three years ago, TEAM ROCKET was\n"
	.string "forced to disband.\p"
	.string "But we’re making a comeback here!$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_TeamRocketGrunt33Defeat::
	.string "Gwah! Don’t get cute!$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_TeamRocketGrunt33::
	.string "We won’t let you ruin our plans\n"
	.string "for our comeback!$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_TeamRocketGrunt21Intro::
	.string "Hey, hey! Keep out of our way!$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_TeamRocketGrunt21Defeat::
	.string "Arggh. I give up.$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_TeamRocketGrunt21::
	.string "Our EXECUTIVES are trying to take\n"
	.string "this place over.\p"
	.string "They have some big plan. I wonder\n"
	.string "what that is?$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_Policeman2::
	.string "Feel free to look around anywhere.\p"
	.string "The DIRECTOR is nice again, just\n"
	.string "as he was before.$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_Sign1::
	.string "Anywhere, Anytime\n"
	.string "POKéMON Radio$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_Sign2::
	.string "PROF.OAK’s POKéMON TALK\n"
	.string "The Hottest Show on the Air!$"

RadioTower_Interior2_Text_Sign3::
	.string "2F SALES$"
